WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:00.940
AGE OF THE SUN, YEAR 498, MARCH 8

00:00.940 --> 00:02.570
AGE OF THE SUN, YEAR 498, MARCH 8
This is the Lese Royal Army,

00:02.570 --> 00:04.689
AGE OF THE SUN, YEAR 498, MARCH 8
we have an announcement to all citizens.

00:05.190 --> 00:09.610
Right now, around the border,
a large number of dragons have appeared.

00:09.610 --> 00:12.370
All citizens are to follow
the directions of the army

00:12.740 --> 00:14.450
and evacuate to the royal capital.

00:16.160 --> 00:19.670
King Femud, the number of refugees
is increasing day by day.

00:20.170 --> 00:22.290
It won't be wise to accept
any more than this.

00:23.040 --> 00:24.880
No problem.

00:24.880 --> 00:27.050
Accept them all.

00:27.050 --> 00:29.800
No need to think of the future.

00:29.800 --> 00:33.260
- It won't be a problem.
- No matter how brilliant and proud he is,

00:33.260 --> 00:37.350
he dies once and it's like
his spirit has left him.

00:37.350 --> 00:39.230
He has no guts.

00:40.060 --> 00:43.190
I thought you would already be a pile of ash,

00:43.190 --> 00:45.900
but it seems you have much power left.

00:45.900 --> 00:47.320
My, oh my!

00:47.990 --> 00:49.780
I'm flattered to have you here.

00:50.240 --> 00:53.030
I will tell you now,
just because.

00:53.030 --> 00:53.740
Huh?

00:53.740 --> 00:57.000
The "Plan" has begun.

00:57.000 --> 01:00.830
In ten days,
we can give 'a peaceful death'

01:00.830 --> 01:03.710
to every person who gathers
in the royal capital.

01:03.710 --> 01:06.210
I see, then nice for hi—

01:08.670 --> 01:10.880
But there is a problem.

01:10.880 --> 01:12.590
Huh, like what?

01:13.090 --> 01:15.560
The Ninth Seat Dornea has been killed.

01:16.100 --> 01:19.640
The killer is this Kingdom's
second princess, Starlia Lese.

01:19.640 --> 01:22.600
The Silverware Princess
and the Argentum Corps, huh?

01:22.600 --> 01:25.770
So I sent both the Fifth Seat, Taratectra,

01:25.770 --> 01:28.690
and the Sixth Seat, Olto Zora,
to handle her.

01:28.690 --> 01:30.860
So it's not me who'll kill her?

01:31.280 --> 01:34.570
- Then, what do you—
- The Third Seat, Disas Trois...

01:34.910 --> 01:39.750
And with him, the Eight Seat, Temruogtaf,
and the Tenth Seat, Grymwelte...

01:40.330 --> 01:44.040
Those on the south border
have taken their last breaths.

01:44.460 --> 01:49.420
That makes the killer either
the Solarian Church or another bloodline, huh?

01:49.420 --> 01:52.340
The Elder said it might not be both.

01:53.090 --> 01:56.970
There is a chance it is
some yet unknown forces.

01:56.970 --> 02:00.220
Awesome! This situation is electrifying!

02:00.220 --> 02:03.270
This situation comes
from your recklessness!

02:03.270 --> 02:05.060
I won't forgive any games from you!

02:05.420 --> 02:08.210
Yeah, sorry about that.

02:08.210 --> 02:10.740
I'll do well next time,
so return my heart, will ya?

02:23.080 --> 02:25.670
Your punishment is hereby
paused temporarily.

02:26.080 --> 02:32.300
I order you, the Second Seat,
Lightning Claw Dragon, Woltekamui.

02:33.090 --> 02:36.550
Sure, just leave it to me, my Monarch.

02:37.260 --> 02:38.260
By the way...

02:39.720 --> 02:44.270
If I did a splendid job,
would there be a rewarding kiss?

02:48.650 --> 02:50.700
Haven't you learned anything?!

02:52.900 --> 02:55.700
I really love making you mad.

02:55.970 --> 02:57.490
Just go already!

02:57.490 --> 03:00.580
No need to shoo me.
Just a bit of lateness won't matter.

03:00.870 --> 03:02.540
You know how I am...

03:02.540 --> 03:03.700
...super fast.

03:26.390 --> 03:33.230
RAGNA CRIMSON

04:43.510 --> 04:44.390
CHAPTER 5: WING

04:44.390 --> 04:45.520
CHAPTER 5: WING
I've gone this far

04:45.520 --> 04:47.230
CHAPTER 5: WING
in following the Blood of the Wing.

04:47.810 --> 04:51.600
I've followed them since I found out what
they're going to do on this land again...

04:52.770 --> 04:54.190
...and yet I lost.

04:56.190 --> 04:57.400
Again...

04:57.940 --> 05:00.530
Again, I survived without doing anything!

05:04.370 --> 05:08.870
Hey! Be silent!
We're in front of the Monarch.

05:18.550 --> 05:20.010
Now, then...

05:20.010 --> 05:21.720
What should we do with a human

05:21.720 --> 05:23.680
BORGIUS, THE SEVENTH SEAT, ARM DRAGON
What should we do with a human

05:23.680 --> 05:26.010
BORGIUS, THE SEVENTH SEAT, ARM DRAGON
who lives in this barren place

05:26.010 --> 05:28.270
BORGIUS, THE SEVENTH SEAT, ARM DRAGON
and tries to kill our progenitor?

05:28.810 --> 05:31.310
Should we hear your
thoughts in turn?

05:31.770 --> 05:32.440
You.

05:32.730 --> 05:33.100
Yes, Sir!

05:33.100 --> 05:34.360
CHANTIORAS, THE TWELFTH SEAT,
I believe there are

05:34.360 --> 05:36.440
CHANTIORAS, THE TWELFTH SEAT,
no other option than killing him, Sir!

05:36.440 --> 05:38.190
UNKNOWN EPITHET
There's no reason to let him live!

05:38.690 --> 05:40.030
BAROM SHUERA, THE ELEVENTH SEAT,

05:40.030 --> 05:42.410
BAROM SHUERA, THE ELEVENTH SEAT,
If the question is what to do with him,

05:42.410 --> 05:44.530
CENTIPEDE DRAGON
why don't we let anyone

05:44.530 --> 05:45.660
who wants to eat him just do it?

05:45.660 --> 05:47.990
GRYMWELTE, THE TENTH SEAT,
Isn't it better to impale and humiliate him?

05:47.990 --> 05:49.330
BLACK MAGIC DRAGON
Isn't it better to impale and humiliate him?

05:49.330 --> 05:49.950
Then let me use him for my experiment.

05:49.950 --> 05:52.620
DORNEA, THE NINTH SEAT, SPIKED BED DRAGON
Then let me use him for my experiment.

05:52.620 --> 05:54.630
DORNEA, THE NINTH SEAT, SPIKED BED DRAGON
I'm in the middle of creating

05:54.630 --> 05:55.590
DORNEA, THE NINTH SEAT, SPIKED BED DRAGON
a new human arrangement.

05:55.590 --> 05:56.290
I have a good idea

05:56.290 --> 05:57.670
TEMROUGTAF, THE EIGHTH SEAT, GLUTTON DRAGON
I have a good idea

05:57.670 --> 05:59.960
TEMROUGTAF, THE EIGHTH SEAT, GLUTTON DRAGON
if you want the brutal way of killing.

05:59.960 --> 06:01.920
TEMROUGTAF, THE EIGHTH SEAT, GLUTTON DRAGON
Cut off his head and eat his brain!

06:01.920 --> 06:03.050
Cut off his head and eat his brain!

06:03.050 --> 06:07.390
OLTO ZORA, THE SIXTH SEAT, MAD MAESTRO DRAGON
I'm not interested in a shabby man like him.

06:07.390 --> 06:09.140
OLTO ZORA, THE SIXTH SEAT, MAD MAESTRO DRAGON
Do whatever you want.

06:09.140 --> 06:10.310
And you, Little Tara?

06:10.770 --> 06:13.020
TARATECTRA, THE FIFTH SEAT, EXPLOSIVE DRAGON
I'm not interested either.

06:13.020 --> 06:15.270
TARATECTRA, THE FIFTH SEAT, EXPLOSIVE DRAGON
Stop calling me Little Tara.

06:15.650 --> 06:17.770
NEBULIM, THE FOURTH SEAT, BARRIER DRAGON
As for me... um...

06:17.770 --> 06:19.570
NEBULIM, THE FOURTH SEAT, BARRIER DRAGON
I think it's better to kill him

06:19.570 --> 06:21.490
NEBULIM, THE FOURTH SEAT, BARRIER DRAGON
without much pain.

06:21.860 --> 06:22.860
Because...

06:23.280 --> 06:24.990
We're before the Monarch.

06:25.240 --> 06:28.530
DISAS TROIS, THE THIRD SEAT,
Do whatever. Just finish this quick.

06:28.530 --> 06:31.410
TEMPEST CELL DRAGON
This human's groans hurt my ears,

06:31.410 --> 06:33.250
even the wind agrees.

06:33.250 --> 06:37.210
WOLTEKAMUI, THE SECOND SEAT,
LIGHTNING CLAW DRAGON

06:37.960 --> 06:40.900
My enemies are gathering
right before me,

06:40.900 --> 06:42.420
but I can't move.

06:43.050 --> 06:44.880
All I can do is groan...

06:47.010 --> 06:49.850
Leo should have been the one
to live that day.

06:50.890 --> 06:52.560
Why am I alive?

06:53.060 --> 06:55.140
Why am I still this weak?

06:56.190 --> 06:58.190
Why? Why?!

07:00.520 --> 07:03.240
But this time,
I won't be saved either.

07:03.240 --> 07:07.200
Then, can I just give up now?

07:08.450 --> 07:10.790
I'm tired of being angry
and holding on.

07:11.910 --> 07:13.910
Can I rest now?

07:15.750 --> 07:18.170
Hey, right now, you feel relieved, huh?

07:21.090 --> 07:23.170
You want to die, right?

07:23.170 --> 07:25.970
Just now, you really
wanted to die, right? Right?!

07:27.470 --> 07:30.300
I've decided that I won't kill you.

07:30.850 --> 07:34.850
You'd better be burned by hatred,
wallow in your despairing weakness

07:34.850 --> 07:37.560
and live in that hell!

07:38.850 --> 07:41.650
I can't accept you
making a selfish decision.

07:41.650 --> 07:43.280
The wind agrees with me.

07:43.280 --> 07:45.240
Shut up, monologue guy.

07:45.240 --> 07:47.780
Since when have all of you
turned into the good guy

07:47.780 --> 07:51.080
who kills someone
who wants to die, huh?!

07:51.580 --> 07:52.870
I'll let him live.

07:53.870 --> 07:56.750
Or do you have any complaints
to the mighty me?

07:57.830 --> 07:59.540
Of course, there is.

08:03.550 --> 08:07.680
I've told you so many times
that I hate people who destroy the peace.

08:08.130 --> 08:10.050
Do you want to be burned again?

08:10.050 --> 08:13.390
Oh, that's scary.
Please spare me that.

08:13.600 --> 08:15.570
Then stay silent.

08:21.810 --> 08:22.860
Everyone.

08:23.400 --> 08:28.490
Though I have listened to your opinions,
please hear my selfish wish.

08:29.490 --> 08:33.870
I want to welcome this person
into the Bloodline.

08:35.830 --> 08:39.460
What? Why the heck?!
We don't need someone—

08:46.590 --> 08:50.720
Nice to meet you.
I am the progenitor of the Winged Bloodline,

08:50.720 --> 08:52.470
Winged Monarch Ultimatia.

08:54.850 --> 09:00.270
That looks like dragon hunter weapons
from a country that used to exist.

09:01.230 --> 09:06.570
With its vibrant people and prosperity,
thriving under a brilliant leader,

09:06.570 --> 09:10.490
their development was remarkable,
it was a very wonderful country.

09:11.110 --> 09:15.830
I destroyed that country wholeheartedly.

09:15.830 --> 09:21.250
I erased every single trace
of that country's existence.

09:21.870 --> 09:26.250
And yet, you lived
and survived even today.

09:26.550 --> 09:31.510
Then, this is the will of God!
Your survival is forgiven by God!

09:31.930 --> 09:34.050
You did amazing for surviving!

09:34.550 --> 09:37.770
I am elated to see that you are alive!

09:38.850 --> 09:41.440
What the heck is this girl saying?

09:41.890 --> 09:44.020
Tia! Tia!

09:44.020 --> 09:46.570
That person probably
doesn't get your words.

09:47.070 --> 09:50.440
Welcoming you to the bloodline means...

09:50.990 --> 09:52.910
...to make you a dragon.

09:53.990 --> 09:54.880
What?

09:55.660 --> 10:02.540
Many assumed that we are
medial dragons gaining human form.

10:02.540 --> 10:04.380
Such lies.

10:04.830 --> 10:07.460
Those you call the low
and medial dragons

10:07.460 --> 10:10.550
are mere beasts that we,
the Bloodline, give birth to.

10:12.880 --> 10:15.720
And so, we, the "Matured" ones are

10:15.720 --> 10:19.220
former humans who received
blood from the progenitor.

10:20.470 --> 10:22.270
Rejoice!

10:22.270 --> 10:27.480
You're allowed to achieve evolution
surpassing humanity into a greater being!

10:29.650 --> 10:30.990
What a joke!

10:32.440 --> 10:34.820
All of you killed Leo!

10:34.820 --> 10:37.070
Not only Leo,
but also so many other people!

10:37.620 --> 10:41.120
Precious ones,
those who could be dear ones,

10:41.120 --> 10:44.370
those who saved me,
those who fought with me,

10:44.370 --> 10:45.670
those I wanted to protect...

10:45.670 --> 10:48.920
All of them! You took them!
You took them all!

10:48.920 --> 10:51.510
Former human?
You're going to make me a dragon?

10:51.510 --> 10:52.670
What a joke!

10:53.130 --> 10:55.800
The only thing I want from you is death!

10:55.800 --> 10:57.680
Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!

10:57.680 --> 10:59.600
Die and disappear!

11:00.510 --> 11:04.270
Once you become the bloodline,
that hatred will disappear too.

11:04.940 --> 11:07.270
I was like that too after all.

11:07.770 --> 11:11.110
Just now, that foolish one said this.

11:11.730 --> 11:13.530
"May you be burned by hatred,

11:13.910 --> 11:17.200
wallow in the despair of powerlessness
and live in that hell."

11:17.990 --> 11:21.540
I want to save you from that hell.

11:23.040 --> 11:27.000
Right now, I will stab this
blood sword into your heart.

11:29.250 --> 11:33.170
Once I do so, the change
into the bloodline will begin.

11:33.170 --> 11:34.380
Stop...

11:35.550 --> 11:40.140
Don't worry.
You won't lose yourself.

11:40.930 --> 11:41.670
It just...

11:44.730 --> 11:47.560
...changes the way
you see this world.

11:54.690 --> 11:56.390
Forget your hatred.

11:56.390 --> 11:59.570
Please live for the will of God with me.

12:00.120 --> 12:02.950
That's the best atonement...

12:02.950 --> 12:04.540
...that I can give to you.

12:08.000 --> 12:12.500
You seem to have an exciting dream
so I didn't wake you up.

12:12.500 --> 12:15.420
Basically, I'm just shutting Slime up.

12:15.420 --> 12:17.590
I get a zip over my mouth!

12:17.590 --> 12:20.140
Do you remember anything useful?

12:22.390 --> 12:26.980
Crimson is so unpleasant.
But I think he's better than Ultimatia.

12:27.770 --> 12:28.600
That woman...

12:30.060 --> 12:31.650
... is kind.

12:31.650 --> 12:35.480
She has killed uncountable lives,
yet she's benevolent!

12:35.900 --> 12:36.780
And that's...

12:37.320 --> 12:38.320
...disgusting.

12:41.490 --> 12:43.330
I will hunt her once more!

12:44.540 --> 12:46.470
I must be able to do it now!

12:47.580 --> 12:52.380
Right now, we don't know yet
how many percent he can utilize his power.

12:52.670 --> 12:57.340
We also don't know the compensation
once he is able to completely unlock it.

12:57.630 --> 13:00.550
If we want to kill only Ultimatia,

13:00.550 --> 13:04.390
several years of robust
preparation is preferable.

13:04.390 --> 13:05.310
But...

13:05.600 --> 13:08.980
They must have realized
what happened at the border

13:08.980 --> 13:10.690
and they would send Woltekamui.

13:11.350 --> 13:13.940
The strongest fighter is away
from the royal capital.

13:14.440 --> 13:17.860
Then, this is the time
to deal with Ultimatia.

13:18.360 --> 13:20.700
This is also an important experiment

13:20.700 --> 13:22.530
- Why are you trying to act cool?
- to decide our future direction.

13:22.530 --> 13:24.780
If we kill Ultimatia, it's a good steal.

13:24.780 --> 13:27.410
If you lose, I'll save you.

13:27.410 --> 13:31.370
You're my important tool, after all.

13:33.830 --> 13:36.090
We can see the royal capital now.

13:37.050 --> 13:41.220
Now, let's hope we can have an audience
with the Winged Monarch.

13:46.810 --> 13:48.430
This is as you wish for, right?

13:48.430 --> 13:52.190
Oh, God, Lese will now lose everything.

13:52.600 --> 13:54.650
Lese? What's that?

13:58.110 --> 14:02.610
This country no longer exists
inside God's mind.

14:03.320 --> 14:07.330
I should erase it. I must erase it.

14:07.830 --> 14:11.500
What doesn't exist in God's mind
must be erased from this world,

14:11.500 --> 14:14.830
what exists in God's mind
must be born in this world.

14:15.380 --> 14:17.500
I am the limb of which to make it true.

14:18.000 --> 14:19.800
That's why the Bloodline exists.

14:21.340 --> 14:26.140
Trois, Ruogtaf, Nea, Welte...

14:26.680 --> 14:28.310
I am deeply saddened.

14:28.890 --> 14:31.480
You didn't manage to be God's limbs.

14:31.890 --> 14:34.190
You weren't fit to be in the Bloodline.

14:37.520 --> 14:42.240
I would at least make the destruction
of this country a tribute to all of you.

14:45.530 --> 14:47.870
Jigglyjig!

14:47.870 --> 14:51.540
It's so big!
It's a stinking big royal capital!

14:51.830 --> 14:53.210
Shut up, Slime.

14:54.920 --> 14:58.420
This is the royal capital,
in the new commerce district.

14:58.420 --> 15:00.630
MAIN CASTLE DISTRICT
It's always been a bustling district,

15:00.630 --> 15:02.340
EDUCATION AND RESEARCH AREA
but we have no business here.

15:02.340 --> 15:04.930
OLD DISTRICT
Now we're going over the second wall

15:04.930 --> 15:06.640
NEW DISTRICT: COMMERCE AREA
into the old district.

15:07.470 --> 15:12.060
You guys have to call me "Veronica."

15:12.060 --> 15:14.600
Okay, Sir! Lady Crinonica!

15:14.600 --> 15:15.890
Crino...?

15:17.480 --> 15:19.440
You understand, right? Rag—

15:21.730 --> 15:22.440
What?

15:22.440 --> 15:24.990
He's puking! That's so gross!

15:25.860 --> 15:29.240
There are so many people.
I feel sick.

15:29.700 --> 15:32.700
Hey, do you think that's funny?

15:33.410 --> 15:35.710
I-I'm not making things up,

15:35.710 --> 15:38.580
I'm really bad with crowds.

15:38.580 --> 15:41.750
I don't need such
a weakness in your setting!

15:41.750 --> 15:42.460
Set...?

15:42.460 --> 15:46.590
If you're getting sick from being in crowds,
what about Ronabera?

15:46.590 --> 15:49.850
That place is also quite a big city, right?

15:49.850 --> 15:52.310
Now that you said it,
I wonder why...

15:52.890 --> 15:54.890
Ah, I know.

15:55.480 --> 15:57.810
That's because Leo is always with me...

15:57.810 --> 15:59.980
Ugh, gross.

15:59.980 --> 16:01.440
Is he reading my mind?

16:01.770 --> 16:03.360
And so?

16:03.360 --> 16:06.650
What now, with you feel sick?
Want to stop the hunt?

16:06.650 --> 16:07.990
There's no problem.

16:08.410 --> 16:12.370
Even if I feel ill or lose all my limbs...

16:12.830 --> 16:16.210
If they are in front of me,
I will hunt them!

16:18.750 --> 16:20.380
I expect much from you.

16:20.380 --> 16:22.380
Come on, stand up.

16:22.380 --> 16:24.090
- Crim—
- Veronica.

16:24.500 --> 16:27.090
I will take care of you for now.

16:27.090 --> 16:29.930
Think of me as Leo's replacement.

16:30.340 --> 16:33.260
There's no way someone like you
can be Leo's replacement.

16:33.260 --> 16:34.390
I'll kill you.

16:39.650 --> 16:41.230
Oh, jiggle!

16:41.230 --> 16:43.570
So this is the old district!

16:43.570 --> 16:46.900
Now, I will begin preparing for my plan.

16:49.150 --> 16:52.320
Slime, look after Ragna here.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.910
Roger that!

16:54.410 --> 16:56.200
I'll be back in around two hours.

16:56.200 --> 16:59.750
Do not do anything stupid
and stay in an inconspicuous place.

17:00.080 --> 17:03.710
Also, do not say the enemy's name.
Of course, do not say mine either.

17:03.710 --> 17:04.920
Rather, don't talk.

17:04.920 --> 17:08.920
If anyone talks to you, go silently
and return here after five minutes.

17:08.920 --> 17:09.970
Now, repeat those!

17:10.310 --> 17:13.180
Do-Don't be conspicuous or talk.

17:13.510 --> 17:17.849
If you're unable to do that,
I'll regard that as an act against me.

17:17.849 --> 17:19.390
Now, I will be leaving.

17:19.390 --> 17:21.730
Have a safe one!

17:27.569 --> 17:30.150
Many people, huh? Sure enough.

17:30.780 --> 17:32.240
But it's too few.

17:32.700 --> 17:36.160
The refugees coming to the royal capital
should've exceeded two million,

17:36.160 --> 17:38.000
and they should have overflow.

17:38.410 --> 17:40.710
Why do they still have space to take more?

17:41.330 --> 17:43.670
It's easy. Their number is decreasing.

17:43.670 --> 17:44.380
MAIN CASTLE DISTRICT

17:44.380 --> 17:46.170
MAIN CASTLE DISTRICT
While no one finds out,

17:46.590 --> 17:48.840
just like a meal disappears
in your stomach,

17:49.630 --> 17:52.380
the erasure of the people
is already underway.

18:02.350 --> 18:04.770
With this, today's disposal is finished.

18:06.110 --> 18:09.190
All we need is to wait until nighttime.

18:09.480 --> 18:10.650
I see.

18:10.650 --> 18:13.660
So, where is the progenitor?

18:15.070 --> 18:16.120
Um...

18:16.700 --> 18:22.000
Lady Ultimatia is inspecting
the refugee's condition herself.

18:22.000 --> 18:24.120
She's going out?!

18:24.120 --> 18:25.880
B-But she told me her location...

18:25.880 --> 18:28.380
You idiot!

18:28.670 --> 18:32.130
Our role as mature ones is to dissuade
the Mistress's selfish wish!

18:32.130 --> 18:37.350
If you always become her yes man,
there is no meaning in being with her!

18:37.350 --> 18:38.680
I-I am sorry...

18:38.680 --> 18:41.310
Leave your sorry for later!

18:41.310 --> 18:42.770
Where is the progenitor?!

18:43.230 --> 18:44.730
The progenitor is now...

18:44.730 --> 18:46.300
...in the old district.

18:56.820 --> 18:58.780
The preparation is now complete.

18:58.780 --> 19:01.330
- Lieutenant General Rowan!
- I see.

19:03.250 --> 19:05.000
Then continue as planned.

19:05.620 --> 19:06.330
Yes, Sir!

19:08.630 --> 19:14.300
Lord Rowan, we're now sleeping at
the boarding house in the new district.

19:15.130 --> 19:18.720
There are so many people in one room
that we can't take it anymore.

19:18.720 --> 19:22.100
Actually, the upper floor of this shop
has been turned into lodging.

19:22.100 --> 19:23.770
How about going there together?

19:25.940 --> 19:27.440
- About that...
- Gulp!

19:27.770 --> 19:30.230
Would you let me in as well,

19:30.900 --> 19:32.980
Lieutenant Rowan?

19:33.490 --> 19:36.490
You should have told me you're coming,
Lady Veronica!

19:36.490 --> 19:39.570
Then as your servant,
I would have...

19:42.450 --> 19:48.790
I ordered you to gather intel
while impersonating the top seat of the army,

19:48.790 --> 19:52.670
yet you seem to enjoy yourself quite a lot,
Lieutenant Rowan, or rather...

19:52.670 --> 19:53.460
Golem!

19:53.460 --> 19:56.880
I-I properly gathered intelligence, really!

19:57.430 --> 19:59.890
Get yourself out here too, Chimera.

20:07.310 --> 20:09.940
Your servant Chimera is here,
Lady Veronica.

20:10.360 --> 20:14.820
I'm ready to devote myself
to any command you may have.

20:15.090 --> 20:17.400
Make Ultimatia clash with Ragna.

20:19.570 --> 20:24.290
Let's combine our strengths
and kill the Winged Monarch!

20:27.250 --> 20:29.170
What's with all this crowd?

20:29.170 --> 20:30.630
What is that curtain there?

20:30.630 --> 20:32.210
The army is doing something.

20:35.300 --> 20:39.300
Hey, stupid pukey human!
We're going to the front!

20:39.300 --> 20:41.430
I-I can't take it anymore...

20:41.800 --> 20:43.890
It's time! Release the curtain!

20:47.520 --> 20:48.940
D-Dragon?!

20:49.390 --> 20:50.690
It's a dragon carcass!

20:51.900 --> 20:54.650
Listen up! People of Lese!

20:54.920 --> 20:58.740
Our country is now being attacked
by an unexpected dragon horde!

20:58.740 --> 21:01.110
All of you must be anxious.

21:01.700 --> 21:04.080
Will this country be no more?

21:04.080 --> 21:08.330
Will my dear families and friends
be eaten by the dragon?

21:08.750 --> 21:11.330
Our answer as the Lese Army...

21:11.330 --> 21:12.580
...is this!

21:17.590 --> 21:22.260
The Lese army has killed several
hundreds of the attacking dragon horde!

21:22.760 --> 21:25.220
The Lese army is winning
against the dragon!

21:25.720 --> 21:27.680
We promise you!

21:27.970 --> 21:32.310
We will hunt all dragons
who dare bear fang at our kingdom

21:32.310 --> 21:37.030
and we'll return a peaceful life
to our people!

21:40.820 --> 21:42.950
All hail Lese!

21:43.740 --> 21:45.370
All hail Lese!

21:50.160 --> 21:52.920
Lowly human, getting carried away so easily.

21:52.920 --> 21:56.710
I can completely eat
that many in just one minute.

21:56.710 --> 21:59.380
- It's a trap...
- What? Do you want to puke?

22:02.090 --> 22:05.430
A brain like mine
doesn't know the purpose.

22:06.260 --> 22:09.180
But the one who makes them do this,
it must be...

22:20.530 --> 22:22.030
Also, one more thing.

22:22.990 --> 22:25.200
Since there's a possibility,
I'll add this.

22:25.700 --> 22:28.490
If you happen to find that woman...

22:29.200 --> 22:32.460
Listen. Do not go after her alone.

22:32.800 --> 22:35.920
The moment you do so,
this hunt is over.

22:39.630 --> 22:41.050
Are you okay?

22:43.260 --> 22:47.010
You don't look so good.
Are you feeling unwell?

22:48.600 --> 22:50.970
Ulti... mati...
